#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/settings.md:3
#: 16687226acc6473c873a427d337abf8c
msgid ""
"`Settings` 用来调整显示、导入导出、NEP 后端和绘图样式。刚开始不需要全部改；只"
"有当你遇到加载慢、显示卡顿、预测慢、导出格式不符合下游要求，或想切换 CPU/"
"CUDA 后端时，再来这里。"
msgstr ""
"Use `Settings` to adjust rendering, import and export behavior, the NEP "
"backend, and plot styles. You do not need to tune everything at first. "
"Change a setting when you encounter slow loading or rendering, slow "
"prediction, an incompatible export format, or a need to switch between CPU "
"and CUDA."

