#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/settings.md:20
#: 39e48bce188f4558905a0ae4af3c0330
msgid "NEP 后端"
msgstr "NEP backend"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/settings.md:22
#: c563457104054027af05a27b4e231bf1
msgid "`NEP Backend` 控制预测时使用 CPU、CUDA，还是由程序自动选择。"
msgstr ""
"`NEP Backend` controls whether prediction uses CPU, CUDA, or automatic "
"backend selection."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/settings.md:24
#: 0fb82a34428f434bb74df1adfc0a50a1
msgid ""
"`Auto`：默认路径；CUDA 可用且当前模型受支持时使用 CUDA，否则在任务开始前明确"
"提示并使用 CPU。运行中不会静默切换后端。"
msgstr ""
"`Auto`: the default path. It uses CUDA when available and supported by the "
"current model; otherwise it explains the decision before the task starts and "
"uses CPU. It does not silently switch backend during execution."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/settings.md:25
#: b38dde7b928a4e44abc4e7fc7368f6de
msgid "`CPU`：适合没有可用 GPU、驱动不匹配，或只是少量结构快速查看。"
msgstr ""
"`CPU`: use when no compatible GPU is available or when inspecting only a few "
"structures."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/settings.md:26
#: f9404743b1e741389f00b8e40ede16b8
msgid ""
"`CUDA`：明确要求 NVIDIA CUDA 后端；不可用时直接报错并说明驱动或安装问题。"
msgstr ""
"`CUDA`: explicitly require the NVIDIA CUDA backend. If unavailable, the "
"application reports the driver or installation problem instead of changing "
"backend."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/settings.md:28
#: c842b5d896004a238303465d3e11fa06
msgid ""
"`NEP Chunk Max Atoms` 决定一次预测分块包含的总原子数，CPU 和 CUDA 使用相同语"
"义。遇到显存或内存不足时调小；单个结构本身超过 CUDA 可用规模时应改用 CPU，因"
"为单结构不能安全拆分。"
msgstr ""
"`NEP Chunk Max Atoms` sets the total atom count allowed in one prediction "
"chunk, with the same meaning on CPU and CUDA. Reduce it when device or host "
"memory is insufficient. If one structure alone exceeds the CUDA capacity, "
"use CPU because a single structure cannot be split safely."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/settings.md:30
#: a8e020d994b04c3b8de7ce81aae16a25
msgid ""
"`Data Precision` 控制导入 DFT/结构数据后的存储精度。常规可保持默认；只有在内"
"存压力明显或需要保留更高精度数值时再改。"
msgstr ""
"`Data Precision` controls the storage precision of imported DFT and "
"structure data. Keep the default for normal work. Change it only to address "
"clear memory pressure or a requirement to retain higher-precision values."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/settings.md:32
#: f9b711d3f2354c29b8e5a258efb37eb6
msgid ""
"`NEP Settings` 中的运行时健康项会显示 NepTrainKit 原生辅助模块、`nep-"
"adapters` 版本以及 CPU/CUDA 可用状态。点击 `NEP runtime updates` 可以从 PyPI "
"手动检查兼容更新。每次打开软件后也会在后台执行一次运行时检查：没有更新或网络"
"检查失败时保持静默，发现新版本时弹出安装提示。程序会校验 wheel 的 SHA256，并"
"在独立进程中确认导入和 CPU 后端可用后才切换版本；更新在重启 NepTrainKit 后生"
"效。验证失败时继续使用原版本。"
msgstr ""
"The runtime health section under `NEP Settings` reports NepTrainKit's native "
"helper modules, the `nep-adapters` version, and CPU/CUDA availability. Use "
"`NEP runtime updates` to check PyPI manually for a compatible update. The "
"application also checks once in the background after startup: no-update and "
"network-failure results remain silent, while an available version opens an "
"installation prompt. Before activation, NepTrainKit verifies the wheel "
"SHA256 and uses an isolated process to confirm that it imports and that the "
"CPU backend is usable. The update takes effect after restarting NepTrainKit; "
"a failed validation leaves the existing version active."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/settings.md:34
#: 67f3dcada4614b14b8a79c8be51c425e
msgid ""
"通过 pip 安装 NepTrainKit 时，更新后的运行时保存在用户配置目录；Nuitka 独立版"
"则保存在 `NepTrainKit.exe` 旁的 `runtime/nep-adapters/versions`，当前版和上一"
"版会保留用于恢复。"
msgstr ""
"For a pip installation, updated runtimes are stored in the user "
"configuration directory. In a standalone Nuitka build, they are stored next "
"to `NepTrainKit.exe` under `runtime/nep-adapters/versions`; the current and "
"previous versions are retained for recovery."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/settings.md:36
#: f992b9e2e4e04fcd874626ed7a39e9b6
msgid "绘图和结构显示"
msgstr "Plots and structure rendering"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/settings.md:38
#: 518f6f9d550f41fc9245f6864f9c2c8c
msgid "Plot Settings 只影响显示，不改变底层数据。"
msgstr ""
"Plot Settings affect presentation only; they do not alter the underlying "
"data."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/settings.md:40
#: 0f5e2faf14fb4ee4ab90f88caf4f8274
msgid ""
"`Scatter edge color` / `Scatter face color` / `Face alpha`：散点默认颜色和透"
"明度。"
msgstr ""
"`Scatter edge color`, `Scatter face color`, and `Face alpha`: default "
"scatter colors and opacity."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/settings.md:41
#: a92a7e5e63f045ccb16f59791eb65773
msgid ""
"`PyQtGraph scatter size` / `VisPy scatter size` / `VisPy antialias`：不同画布"
"后端的点大小和抗锯齿。"
msgstr ""
"`PyQtGraph scatter size`, `VisPy scatter size`, and `VisPy antialias`: point "
"size and antialiasing for each canvas backend."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/settings.md:42
#: deb20dbf94dd4564a16dfaac61e5cf5d
msgid ""
"`Structure background` / `Lattice line color`：结构视图背景和晶格线颜色。"
msgstr ""
"`Structure background` and `Lattice line color`: background and cell-line "
"colors in the structure view."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/settings.md:43
#: b9b31d8a914646339dd1c4d68a47c8b0
msgid ""
"`Selected color` / `Show color` / `Current marker color` / `Current marker "
"size`：选中点、高亮点和当前结构标记的显示样式。"
msgstr ""
"`Selected color`, `Show color`, `Current marker color`, and `Current marker "
"size`: styles for selected points, highlighted points, and the current-"
"structure marker."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/settings.md:45
#: d870c704e38c43ea8f5edc73ee722328
msgid ""
"如果只是想判断结构是否异常，优先调整点大小和当前结构标记；不要为了配色反复改"
"变数据筛选流程。"
msgstr ""
"When the goal is to spot anomalous structures, adjust point size and the "
"current-structure marker first. Do not change the filtering workflow merely "
"to compensate for plot colors."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/settings.md:47
#: dbe4b45f0ea74bbbba5bf048783833ca
msgid "NEP89 和更新"
msgstr "NEP89 and software updates"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/settings.md:49
#: d9405ec49bf8427d887a77d51e23844f
msgid ""
"`About NEP89` 会检查并更新内置 `nep89.txt`。NEP89 可以用于某些候选结构的快速"
"预筛，但它不是所有材料体系的可靠模型。使用时把它当作异常结构筛查工具，不要当"
"作 DFT 标签来源。"
msgstr ""
"`About NEP89` checks for and updates the bundled `nep89.txt`. NEP89 can "
"quickly prescreen candidates for some systems, but it is not reliable for "
"every material. Use it to flag anomalies, never as a source of DFT labels."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/settings.md:51
#: 1a326eddc6b94959b0c5a9d0f3e77044
msgid "如果你有当前体系自己的 NEP 模型，优先使用自己的模型做预筛。"
msgstr ""
"If a NEP model trained for the current system is available, prefer it for "
"prescreening."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/settings.md:53
#: 51c3b549098b4c21963be203a2b76d0e
msgid ""
"`About` 里的 `Check for Updates` 用于检查 NepTrainKit 新版本。这个检查只影响"
"软件版本提示，不会自动修改你的训练数据。"
msgstr ""
"`Check for Updates` under `About` checks for a newer NepTrainKit release. It "
"only updates the version notification and never modifies training data "
"automatically."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/settings.md:55
#: aeed312a0d8a4604b8f015ed5671a3a8
msgid "修改设置的原则"
msgstr "Guidelines for changing settings"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/settings.md:57
#: ef33d919122f45e58d021fe1cc807f82
msgid "先确认问题属于显示、读取、预测、导出还是卡片流程，再改对应设置。"
msgstr ""
"First determine whether the problem is in rendering, input, prediction, "
"export, or the card workflow, then change only the corresponding setting."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/settings.md:58
#: 8204b46496b749bb94bcd2f87f8c2f7e
msgid "一次只改一个关键选项，方便判断影响。"
msgstr ""
"Change one important option at a time so its effect remains attributable."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/settings.md:59
#: 06f15e079c1e4ff3bd90e1a75f85e1f3
msgid "涉及数据清洗阈值时，改完要抽查被选中的结构，而不是只看数量变化。"
msgstr ""
"After changing a data-cleaning threshold, inspect some of the selected "
"structures rather than judging the change only by the count."

#~ msgid "按卡片 `group` 分组显示 Make Dataset 菜单"
#~ msgstr "Group the Make Dataset menu by each card's `group`"

#~ msgid "`Auto`：默认路径，程序优先尝试可用后端。"
#~ msgstr "`Auto`: the default path; NepTrainKit selects an available backend."

#~ msgid "`GPU`：适合批量预测或较大候选池。"
#~ msgstr "`GPU`: use for batch prediction or a large candidate pool."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`GPU Batch Size` 决定一次送入 GPU 的结构数量。显存不足时调小；显存充足但吞"
#~ "吐低时可以调大。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`GPU Batch Size` controls how many structures are sent to the GPU at "
#~ "once. Reduce it after an out-of-memory failure; increase it when memory "
#~ "is available but throughput is low."
